## 3. Background

### 3.1 Emotion dataset

The **Emotion** dataset contains short English texts (often tweet-like) labeled with one of six emotions. Splits are provided for train, validation, and test, enabling fair comparison with published benchmarks.

### 3.2 DistilBERT

**DistilBERT** is a distilled version of BERT that retains most of BERT’s accuracy with fewer parameters and faster inference. For a Colab-sized project, it is an appropriate choice for sequence classification.

### 3.3 SeamlessM4T (optional module)

**SeamlessM4T v2** is a multilingual multimodal model supporting speech-to-text and speech-to-speech translation. In this project it was used to generate translated strings and audio from an English sample, which were then available for downstream emotion analysis.

