## 10. Conclusion

The project successfully demonstrates a complete **NLP emotion classification pipeline** using modern Hugging Face tooling and DistilBERT fine-tuning on the Emotion dataset. Quantitative evaluation on the test split provides measurable outcomes (accuracy and F1), and the optional SeamlessM4T integration shows a path toward **multilingual, speech-aware** affective applications.

With the improvements listed in Future Work—especially multilingual data, deployment, and explainability—this prototype can evolve into a robust research or product-ready emotion analytics module.

